======= <Clean all logs> =======

>>> rm -rf _host1 _host2 nvmeibc.trace.json dict.*.json *.binlog*.* libfmtrs.so

======= <Compile> =======

>>> ./build_block_testing.sh build > /dev/null

======= <Run unitest> =======

>>> ./blk_unitest -tracedbg 6 -tracertest >/dev/null 2>&1

======= <Shuffle binlog> =======

======= <Damage binlog> =======

======= <Create duplicate buffer> =======

======= <Simple> =======

